,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-007-006-p02","sourceId":"b3-007-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[13,30],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"which deals with claims from people who fed their money to a machine or to their dog.","start":47.16,"end":52.21,"score":0.983,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-007-007","sourceId":"b3-007-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Dogs, it seems, love to chew up money!","start":53.22,"end":56.19,"score":0.958,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-007-008","sourceId":"b3-007-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"A recent case concerns Jane Butlin whose fiance, John, runs a successful furniture business.","start":57.78,"end":65.51,"score":0.921,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-007-009","sourceId":"b3-007-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"John had a very good day and put his wallet containing ￡3, 000 into the microwave oven for safekeeping.","start":66.82,"end":75.16,"score":0.909,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["low-word-confidence"]},{"id":"b3-007-010","sourceId":"b3-007-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,6],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Then he and Jane went horse-riding.","start":76.09,"end":78.86,"score":0.967,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-007-011","sourceId":"b3-007-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,22],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"When they got home, Jane cooked their dinner in the microwave oven and without realizing it, cooked her fiance's wallet as well.","start":80.09,"end":88.18,"score":0.931,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-007-012","sourceId":"b3-007-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Imagine their dismay when they found a beautifully-cooked wallet and notes turned to ash!","start":89.66,"end":95.77,"score":0.956,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-007-013-p01","sourceId":"b3-007-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"John went to see his bank manager who sent the remains of wallet","start":97.06,"end":100.72,"score":0.975,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-007-013-p02","sourceId":"b3-007-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[13,30],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"and the money to the special department of the Bank of England in Newcastle: the Mutilated Ladies!","start":100.92,"end":107.05,"score":0.986,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-007-014","sourceId":"b3-007-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"They examined the remains and John got all his money back.","start":107.92,"end":112.8,"score":0.979,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-007-015","sourceId":"b3-007-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'So long as there's something to identify, we will give people their money back,' said a spokeswoman for the Bank.","start":113.74,"end":119.84,"score":0.99,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b3-007-016","sourceId":"b3-007-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'Last year, we paid ￡1.5 million on 21,000 claims.'","start":120.9,"end":127.17,"score":0.954,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]}]}
